lysis\",\n      \"description\": \"Research real-world metrics on inference efficiency, including token processing time, memory bandwidth usage, parallelization potential, and hardware-specific performance (e.g., GPU, TPU) for both MoE and dense models. Collect data on average latency, throughput, and the impact of sparsity on real-time performance, including benchmarks from published papers or industry reports.\",\n      \"step_type\": \"research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"need_search\": true,\n      \"title\": \"Model Quality and Performance Evaluation\",\n      \"description\": \"Gather comprehensive data on model quality metrics such as benchmark scores (e.g., MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval), generalization ability, robustness, and downstream task performance for both MoE and dense LLMs. Include comparative studies that evaluate performance across different domains and task types, and assess whether MoE models achieve comparable or superior quality despite their architectural complexity.\",\n      \"step_type\": \"research\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
